<P STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 17.9pt 0pt 0; text-align: center">SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.95pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 35.95pt"><B>THIS SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT
</B>(<B>&ldquo;Settlement Agreement</B>&rdquo;) is made this 5<SUP>th</SUP> of June, 2025 (the &ldquo;<B>Effective Date</B>&rdquo;), by
and among Boustead Securities, LLC (&ldquo;<B>Boustead&rdquo;), </B>CleanCore Solutions, Inc. (&ldquo;<B>CleanCore</B>&rdquo;), and CC
Acquisition Corp. (&ldquo;<B>CC Acquisition,</B>&rdquo; and together with CleanCore, &ldquo;<B>CleanCore parties</B>&rdquo;). Boustead,
CleanCore and CC Acquisition Corp. are together referred to in this Agreement as the &ldquo;Parties&rdquo; and each individually referred
to in this Agreement as a &ldquo;Party.&rdquo;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, on or about September
21, 2022, Boustead and CC Acquisition entered into an Engagement Letter (&ldquo;Engagement Letter&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, on or about April
25, 2024, Boustead and CleanCore entered into an Underwriting Agreement (&ldquo;Underwriting Agreement,&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, Boustead asserts
that it is owed certain compensation stemming from the Engagement Letter, Underwriting Agreement, or any other agreements or amendments
thereto (collectively, the &ldquo;Boustead Agreements&rdquo;) among the parties, including but not limited to compensation related to
a transaction on or about April 15, 2025 (&ldquo;Sanzonate Transaction&rdquo;), and a transaction on or about April 16, 2025 (&ldquo;Note
Transaction&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, CleanCore wishes
to pursue one or more transactions, which transaction (or transactions) may aggregate to Fifty Million and 00/100 Dollars ($50,000,000)
or more (such as the transaction discussed between the Parties on June 2, 2025, with a representative of Curvature Securities, LLC, or
any other financings, offerings or other transactions to raise capital, to which the Company is a Party, after the Effective Date) (&ldquo;TRANSACTIONS&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, CleanCore asserts
that the existence of the Boustead Agreements, including but not limited to any ROFR obligations thereunder, may impede consummation of
the TRANSACTIONS; and</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, the Parties wish
to come to an Agreement respecting the Boustead Agreements, and wish to modify the obligations thereunder, including but not limited to
any ROFR obligations thereunder.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>


